        "text": "<thinking> To implement the task, I need to create a Python file named `query_metric_window.py` that queries recent datapoints for a named metric over a time window using a concrete external provider. I will use the AWS CloudWatch service as the external provider, which is a concrete and identifiable service for querying metrics. The code will import the necessary AWS SDK for Python (Boto3) and use it to query metrics from CloudWatch. </thinking>\n",
